# A 仮身 of ファイル変換 carried with the pointer moved straight after the press,
# before the program has asked the desktop to carry it (design 10.4), for
# tools/ui_run.py. In the shot, what follows the pointer must be the 仮身
# pressed (the row of .ico, turned over), held where it was pressed, and not
# what lay further along the way the pointer went.
dclick 80 141
wait 1500
open 01a0d8c4-52b1-7c21-9a31-4f5e6d7c8b91
expect xfconv: ready
wait 500
dclick 182 207
expect xfconv: window vblka1
wait 800
win vblka1
hold 300 343
move 330 353
move 360 363
move 420 383
wait 400
move 800 620
wait 300
shot xfc_carry
up
wait 800
